{"id":627,"slug":"tabs-021","category_slug":"tabs","name":"可切换分段控制器","description":"iOS 分段交互","tags":["Tabs","交互","分段","iOS","扁平","极简","Linear"],"preview_html":"\n<div style=\"padding:20px\" onclick=\"var g=this;var idx=Array.prototype.indexOf.call(g.children,event.target.closest('div'));if(idx<0)return;g.querySelectorAll('div').forEach(function(d,i){d.style.background=i===idx?'#fff':'transparent';d.style.boxShadow=i===idx?'0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.1)':'none';d.style.color=i===idx?'#333':'#666'})\">\n  <div style=\"display:inline-flex;background:#f0f0f0;border-radius:8px;padding:3px\">\n    <div style=\"padding:6px 20px;background:#fff;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.1);cursor:pointer\">推荐</div>\n    <div style=\"padding:6px 20px;font-size:13px;color:#666;cursor:pointer\">最新</div>\n    <div style=\"padding:6px 20px;font-size:13px;color:#666;cursor:pointer\">热门</div>\n  </div>\n</div>","prompt":"设计可切换分段控制器：点击段切换白底选中态。","prompt_short":"可切换分段控制器：iOS 分段交互 风格 Tabs / 交互 / 分段 / iOS","sort":10,"category_name":"标签页 Tabs","category_group":"导航与结构","prompt_refactor":"把现有页面里的「可切换分段控制器」改成这个观感，只改样式，不重写。\n\n技术栈：按我项目现有的（Vue / Quasar 或 React / Tailwind 均可），不要升级版本，不要引入新依赖。\n\n参照描述：\n设计可切换分段控制器：点击段切换白底选中态。\n\n约束：\n1. props 名称、数据字段、组件层级一律不动，只调整布局 / 间距 / 字号 / 颜色 / 圆角 / 阴影\n2. 需要动效时用项目已有能力降级实现，不新增动画库\n3. 先给 2-3 个方向（每个方向改了什么、风险在哪），我确认后再出代码\n4. 出代码时给完整单文件版本，不要给 diff\n验收：功能不变，构建能过。风格关键词：Tabs / 交互 / 分段 / iOS / 扁平 / 极简","url":"/v/tabs-021/","md_url":"/api/v/tabs-021.md","related":[{"slug":"tabs-001","name":"antd Tabs","tags":["桌面端","Tabs","antd"]},{"slug":"tabs-002","name":"卡片式 Tabs","tags":["桌面端","Tabs","卡片"]},{"slug":"tabs-003","name":"iOS 底部 Tab","tags":["移动端","Tab","iOS"]},{"slug":"tabs-004","name":"垂直 Tabs","tags":["桌面端","Tabs","垂直"]},{"slug":"tabs-005","name":"顶部下划线 Tabs","tags":["Tabs","标签页","antd"]},{"slug":"tabs-006","name":"卡片式 Tabs","tags":["Tabs","卡片","标签页"]}]}